From b4411bffa87cccd9c5098a5fc3ccdc7093a1159d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: atomozero <bernardi.andrea@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 23:09:17 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 10/42] Bluetooth catalogs: the Italian fingerprints after the
 hash change

The catalog key hash now adds the bytes as signed char on every
architecture; the fingerprints of catalogs with keys that are not ASCII
change with it.

Signed-off-by: atomozero <bernardi.andrea@gmail.com>
---
 data/catalogs/preferences/bluetooth/it.catkeys | 2 +-
 data/catalogs/servers/bluetooth/it.catkeys     | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/data/catalogs/preferences/bluetooth/it.catkeys b/data/catalogs/preferences/bluetooth/it.catkeys
index 313e4909d3..6288b66b45 100644
--- a/data/catalogs/preferences/bluetooth/it.catkeys
+++ b/data/catalogs/preferences/bluetooth/it.catkeys
@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@
-1	italian	x-vnd.Haiku-BluetoothPrefs	2826205708
+1	italian	x-vnd.Haiku-BluetoothPrefs	3244669196
 Laptop	Settings view		Portatile
 Only from trusted devices	Settings view		Solo da dispositivi affidabili
 15 secs	Settings view		15 secondi
diff --git a/data/catalogs/servers/bluetooth/it.catkeys b/data/catalogs/servers/bluetooth/it.catkeys
index 944a6cd5a9..294c21bafc 100644
--- a/data/catalogs/servers/bluetooth/it.catkeys
+++ b/data/catalogs/servers/bluetooth/it.catkeys
@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@
-1	italian	x-vnd.Haiku-bluetooth_server	1130325196
+1	italian	x-vnd.Haiku-bluetooth_server	2483031756
 Stopping the Bluetooth server failed.	BluetoothReplicant		Arresto del server Bluetooth non riuscito.
 Bluetooth error	BluetoothReplicant		Errore bluetooth
 Settings…	BluetoothReplicant		Impostazioni…
